      "evidence_ids": [
        "E-TEST",
        "E-VALIDATION-FINAL"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "AC-02",
      "criterion": "Known member events 1,0,2 and stale closure assert monotonic phase/total values against equal-phase and member-plus-final-assessment units. Opaque delayed phase remains unavailable at 33%; publication failure and cancellation exclude100. Real adapter with controlled Cargo/Geiger emits completion events only after member assessment.",
      "status": "APPROVED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "E-TEST",
        "E-VALIDATION-FINAL"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "AC-03",
      "criterion": "State fixtures cover passed/findings/failed/error/blocked/skipped/recorded; aggregation distinguishes operational failure precedence. Unknown warning/skip counts remain unavailable and known empty arrays become zero. TERM before next selection and during publication produces CANCELADA. Permanent blocks contain action, duration, limits and diagnostic references.",
      "status": "APPROVED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "E-TEST",
        "E-VALIDATION-FINAL"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "AC-04",
      "criterion": "Structured Ruff metadata yields numbered source-backed locations/rules; identical rows group with counts and unlocated remainder is explicit. Findings plus operational failure retain both diagnostics. Raw and structured control injections are not replayed, arbitrary message/reason text is omitted, exact adapter reasons alone supply causal explanations. Retained tool/stdout locator is asserted to exist after publication.",
      "status": "APPROVED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "E-TEST",
        "E-VALIDATION-FINAL"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "AC-05",
      "criterion": "Tests compare captured binary stdout/stderr bytes including NUL/nonUTF8/escape content, preserve nested Geiger streams and process exit23, require empty plan stderr and valid JSON, reject CR/ESC in redirected presentation and verify PTY NO_COLOR permanent blocks and elapsed updates. Source inspection confirms no color SGR generation.",
      "status": "APPROVED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "E-TEST",
        "E-VALIDATION-FINAL"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "AC-06",
      "criterion": "Current 49-regression log covers source/policy drift rejection, executable pinning, selection/defaults, raw status, malformed native reports and cancellation cleanup isolated from parallel execution. Publication barrier waits for pipe EOF, retained results and removed temporary run; emergency capture failure still attempts publication and returns2. Independent review resolved/reobserved three defects; independent validator inspected current implementation and oracles. Baseline comparison preserves101 existing records and all other keys, adds exactly8 reviewed occurrences; catalog changes limited to static-review source/policy identity/reason.",
      "status": "APPROVED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "E-TEST",
        "E-VALIDATION-FINAL"
      ]
    }
  ],
